<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8"/>
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
<title>Defend Your Experience - AI Interview Coach</title>
<style>
:root {
  --primary: #7c3aed;
  --primary-light: #a78bfa;
  --secondary: #6d28d9;
  --accent: #06b6d4;
  --success: #059669;
  --warning: #d97706;
  --danger: #dc2626;
  
  --bg-dark: #0f172a;
  --bg-darker: #0a0e27;
  --bg-card: #1e293b;
  --bg-input: #1a2641;
  --bg-hover: #2d3d54;
  
  --text-primary: #f1f5f9;
  --text-secondary: #cbd5e1;
  --text-muted: #94a3b8;
  
  --border: rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
  --shadow-sm: 0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
  --shadow-md: 0 4px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
  --shadow-lg: 0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
}

* {
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

html, body {
  font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--bg-dark) 0%, var(--bg-darker) 100%);
  color: var(--text-primary);
  min-height: 100vh;
}

body { padding: 0; }

.app {
  min-height: 100vh;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
}

/* HEADER */
.header {
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(124,58,237,0.12), rgba(109,40,217,0.08));
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  padding: 24px;
  position: sticky;
  top: 0;
  z-index: 100;
  backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
}

.header-content {
  max-width: 1400px;
  margin: 0 auto;
}

.header h1 {
  font-size: 28px;
  font-weight: 800;
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), var(--primary-light));
  -webkit-background-clip: text;
  -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
  background-clip: text;
  margin-bottom: 4px;
}

.header-subtitle {
  font-size: 12px;
  color: var(--text-secondary);
}

/* MAIN */
.main {
  flex: 1;
  max-width: 1400px;
  width: 100%;
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 32px 24px;
}

/* CONTAINER */
.container {
  max-width: 900px;
  margin: 0 auto;
}

/* EXPLAINER */
.explainer {
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(124,58,237,0.1), rgba(6,182,212,0.05));
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: 12px;
  padding: 20px;
  margin-bottom: 24px;
}

.explainer-title {
  font-size: 14px;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--primary);
  margin-bottom: 8px;
}

.explainer-text {
  font-size: 13px;
  color: var(--text-secondary);
  line-height: 1.6;
  margin-bottom: 12px;
}

.explainer-list {
  font-size: 12px;
  color: var(--text-secondary);
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 6px;
  margin-left: 16px;
}

.explainer-list li {
  list-style: none;
}

.explainer-list li:before {
  content: "→ ";
  color: var(--accent);
  margin-right: 6px;
}

/* UPLOAD SECTION */
.upload-area {
  background: var(--bg-card);
  border: 2px dashed var(--border);
  border-radius: 12px;
  padding: 40px 20px;
  text-align: center;
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: all 0.3s ease;
  margin-bottom: 24px;
}

.upload-area:hover {
  border-color: var(--primary);
  background: var(--bg-hover);
}

.upload-area.active {
  border-color: var(--primary);
  background: rgba(124,58,237,0.1);
}

.upload-icon {
  font-size: 40px;
  margin-bottom: 12px;
}

.upload-title {
  font-size: 14px;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--text-primary);
  margin-bottom: 4px;
}

.upload-text {
  font-size: 12px;
  color: var(--text-secondary);
}

.upload-input {
  display: none;
}

/* SESSION */
.session-container {
  display: none;
}

.session-container.active {
  display: block;
}

.interview-section {
  background: var(--bg-card);
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: 12px;
  padding: 24px;
  margin-bottom: 24px;
}

.question-box {
  margin-bottom: 20px;
}

.question-label {
  font-size: 11px;
  font-weight: 700;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.5px;
  color: var(--text-muted);
  margin-bottom: 8px;
}

.question-text {
  font-size: 15px;
  font-weight: 600;
  color: var(--text-primary);
  margin-bottom: 16px;
  line-height: 1.6;
}

.question-context {
  background: var(--bg-input);
  border-left: 3px solid var(--primary);
  padding: 12px;
  border-radius: 6px;
  font-size: 12px;
  color: var(--text-secondary);
  margin-bottom: 16px;
  font-style: italic;
}

/* ANSWER AREA */
.answer-area {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 12px;
  margin-bottom: 16px;
}

.answer-input {
  width: 100%;
  padding: 12px;
  background: var(--bg-input);
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: 6px;
  color: var(--text-primary);
  font-size: 13px;
  font-family: inherit;
  resize: vertical;
  min-height: 100px;
}

.answer-input:focus {
  outline: none;
  border-color: var(--primary);
  box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(124,58,237,0.1);
}

/* BUTTONS */
.btn {
  padding: 10px 16px;
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: 6px;
  background: transparent;
  color: var(--text-secondary);
  font-size: 12px;
  font-weight: 600;
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: all 0.2s ease;
}

.btn:hover {
  border-color: var(--primary);
  color: var(--primary);
}

.btn-primary {
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), var(--secondary));
  border: none;
  color: white;
}

.btn-primary:hover {
  transform: translateY(-2px);
  box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(124,58,237,0.3);
}

.btn-group {
  display: flex;
  gap: 8px;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
}

/* FEEDBACK */
.feedback-box {
  background: rgba(59,130,246,0.1);
  border-left: 3px solid var(--accent);
  padding: 12px;
  border-radius: 6px;
  font-size: 12px;
  color: var(--text-secondary);
  line-height: 1.6;
  margin-bottom: 16px;
}

.feedback-title {
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--accent);
  margin-bottom: 4px;
}

/* PROGRESS */
.progress-section {
  background: var(--bg-input);
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: 8px;
  padding: 16px;
  margin-bottom: 20px;
}

.progress-label {
  font-size: 11px;
  font-weight: 700;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--text-muted);
  margin-bottom: 8px;
}

.progress-bar {
  width: 100%;
  height: 8px;
  background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
  border-radius: 4px;
  overflow: hidden;
}

.progress-fill {
  height: 100%;
  background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--primary), var(--primary-light));
  width: var(--width, 0%);
  transition: width 0.3s ease;
}

.progress-text {
  font-size: 11px;
  color: var(--text-muted);
  margin-top: 6px;
}

/* DEFENSE RATING */
.rating-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
  gap: 12px;
}

.rating-card {
  background: var(--bg-input);
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: 8px;
  padding: 12px;
  text-align: center;
}

.rating-score {
  font-size: 24px;
  font-weight: 800;
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), var(--primary-light));
  -webkit-background-clip: text;
  -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
  background-clip: text;
  margin-bottom: 4px;
}

.rating-label {
  font-size: 11px;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--text-muted);
  text-transform: uppercase;
}

.rating-name {
  font-size: 12px;
  color: var(--text-secondary);
  margin-top: 4px;
}

/* EMPTY STATE */
.empty-state {
  text-align: center;
  padding: 60px 20px;
  color: var(--text-muted);
}

.empty-icon {
  font-size: 48px;
  margin-bottom: 12px;
}

.empty-title {
  font-size: 16px;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--text-primary);
  margin-bottom: 6px;
}

.empty-text {
  font-size: 13px;
  color: var(--text-secondary);
}

/* REPORT */
.report-section {
  background: var(--bg-card);
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: 12px;
  padding: 24px;
  margin-bottom: 24px;
}

.report-title {
  font-size: 18px;
  font-weight: 800;
  margin-bottom: 16px;
  color: var(--text-primary);
}

.report-subsection {
  margin-bottom: 20px;
}

.report-subsection-title {
  font-size: 13px;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--primary);
  text-transform: uppercase;
  margin-bottom: 12px;
}

.report-item {
  background: var(--bg-input);
  border-left: 3px solid var(--primary);
  padding: 12px;
  border-radius: 6px;
  margin-bottom: 8px;
  font-size: 12px;
  color: var(--text-secondary);
  line-height: 1.6;
}

.report-item.strong {
  border-left-color: var(--success);
}

.report-item.needs-work {
  border-left-color: var(--warning);
}

.report-status {
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--text-primary);
}

/* LOADING */
.loading {
  display: inline-block;
  width: 6px;
  height: 6px;
  background: var(--primary);
  border-radius: 50%;
  animation: pulse 1.5s infinite;
}

@keyframes pulse {
  0%, 100% { opacity: 1; }
  50% { opacity: 0.3; }
}

/* MODAL */
.modal {
  display: none;
  position: fixed;
  top: 0;
  left: 0;
  right: 0;
  bottom: 0;
  background: rgba(0,0,0,0.7);
  z-index: 1000;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
}

.modal.open {
  display: flex;
}

.modal-content {
  background: var(--bg-card);
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: 12px;
  max-width: 600px;
  max-height: 90vh;
  overflow-y: auto;
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);
  animation: slideUp 0.3s ease;
  padding: 24px;
}

@keyframes slideUp {
  from { transform: translateY(20px); opacity: 0; }
  to { transform: translateY(0); opacity: 1; }
}

.modal-close {
  float: right;
  background: none;
  border: none;
  color: var(--text-muted);
  font-size: 20px;
  cursor: pointer;
}

/* RESPONSIVE */
@media (max-width: 768px) {
  .main {
    padding: 16px;
  }

  .header {
    padding: 16px;
  }

  .header h1 {
    font-size: 20px;
  }

  .question-text {
    font-size: 14px;
  }

  .rating-grid {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  }

  .modal-content {
    margin: 20px;
    max-width: 100%;
  }
}

/* SCROLLBAR */
::-webkit-scrollbar {
  width: 8px;
}

::-webkit-scrollbar-track {
  background: transparent;
}

::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
  background: rgba(124,58,237,0.3);
  border-radius: 4px;
}

::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover {
  background: rgba(124,58,237,0.5);
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="app">
  <!-- HEADER -->
  <div class="header">
    <div class="header-content">
      <h1>🎯 Defend Your Experience</h1>
      <div class="header-subtitle">AI-powered interview coach that challenges you with personalized questions based on your real experience</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- MAIN -->
  <div class="main">
    <div class="container">
      <!-- INITIAL STATE -->
      <div id="initial-state">
        <div class="explainer">
          <div class="explainer-title">💡 How This Works</div>
          <div class="explainer-text">
            This is an adaptive interview coach, not a generic questionnaire. Upload your resume, project description, portfolio, bio, or any document about your experience. I'll extract your claims and challenge you with smart follow-up questions that:
          </div>
          <ul class="explainer-list">
            <li>Target the specific claims YOU make (not generic templates)</li>
            <li>Dig deeper based on your answers, getting progressively more realistic</li>
            <li>Identify weak evidence, vague statements, and missing context</li>
            <li>Help you tell stronger, more confident stories about your work</li>
            <li>Generate a Defense Report showing what's well-defended and what needs work</li>
          </ul>
          <div style="margin-top: 12px; font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-muted); font-style: italic;">
            The goal: Not to fix your resume. To help you confidently defend every claim you make about yourself.
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- UPLOAD AREA -->
        <div class="interview-section">
          <div class="question-label">Step 1: Upload Your Experience</div>
          <div class="upload-area" onclick="triggerUpload()">
            <div class="upload-icon">📄</div>
            <div class="upload-title">Drop your document or click to upload</div>
            <div class="upload-text">Resume, LinkedIn profile, portfolio, bio, project description, or any document about your experience</div>
            <input type="file" class="upload-input" id="fileInput" accept=".txt,.pdf,.md,.docx" onchange="handleFile(event)">
          </div>

          <div style="margin-top: 16px; padding: 12px; background: var(--bg-input); border-radius: 6px; font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-secondary);">
            📋 <strong>Supported formats:</strong> Text (.txt), Markdown (.md), PDF, or Word (.docx). Or paste your content below:
          </div>

          <textarea class="answer-input" id="pasteArea" placeholder="Or paste your resume, bio, project description, or any text about your experience here..." style="margin-top: 12px;"></textarea>

          <button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="startInterview()" style="margin-top: 12px;">Start Interview</button>
        </div>

        <!-- VISUAL STYLE PREFERENCE -->
        <div class="interview-section" style="margin-top: 24px;">
          <div class="question-label">Step 2: (Optional) Visual Style Preference</div>
          <div class="question-text">How do you prefer the interface to look?</div>
          <div class="btn-group">
            <button class="btn" onclick="setStyle('professional')" data-style="professional">🎩 Professional</button>
            <button class="btn" onclick="setStyle('minimalist')" data-style="minimalist">⚪ Minimalist</button>
            <button class="btn" onclick="setStyle('bold')" data-style="bold">🔥 Bold</button>
            <button class="btn" onclick="setStyle('warm')" data-style="warm">☀️ Warm</button>
          </div>
          <div style="font-size: 11px; color: var(--text-muted); margin-top: 8px;">This will adapt colors, typography, and animations to your preference.</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- SESSION STATE -->
      <div id="session-state" class="session-container">
        <!-- PROGRESS -->
        <div class="progress-section">
          <div class="progress-label">Interview Progress</div>
          <div class="progress-bar">
            <div class="progress-fill" id="progressFill"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="progress-text"><span id="questionCount">0</span> / <span id="totalQuestions">0</span> questions</div>
        </div>

        <!-- INTERVIEW -->
        <div id="interview-container" class="interview-section">
          <div id="question-box" class="question-box" style="display: none;">
            <div class="question-label" id="questionLabel"></div>
            <div class="question-text" id="questionText"></div>
            <div class="question-context" id="questionContext" style="display: none;"></div>
            
            <div class="answer-area">
              <textarea class="answer-input" id="answerInput" placeholder="Your response..."></textarea>
            </div>

            <div class="btn-group">
              <button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="submitAnswer()">Submit Answer</button>
              <button class="btn" onclick="skipQuestion()">Skip This Question</button>
              <button class="btn" onclick="endInterview()">End Interview</button>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div id="loading-indicator" style="text-align: center; padding: 20px; display: none;">
            <div style="font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-secondary);">
              <span class="loading" style="margin-right: 8px;"></span>
              Claude is analyzing your answer...
            </div>
          </div>

          <div id="feedback-container" style="display: none;">
            <div class="feedback-box" id="feedbackBox"></div>
            <button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="nextQuestion()">Next Question →</button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- RATING CARDS -->
        <div id="rating-cards" style="display: none;">
          <div style="font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px; color: var(--text-primary);">Defense Assessment</div>
          <div class="rating-grid" id="ratingGrid"></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- REPORT STATE -->
      <div id="report-state" style="display: none;">
        <div class="report-section">
          <div class="report-title">📊 Your Defense Report</div>
          
          <div class="report-subsection">
            <div class="report-subsection-title">Overall Defense Score</div>
            <div class="rating-grid">
              <div class="rating-card">
                <div class="rating-score" id="overallScore">0</div>
                <div class="rating-label">Overall</div>
              </div>
              <div class="rating-card">
                <div class="rating-score" id="clarityScore">0</div>
                <div class="rating-label">Clarity</div>
              </div>
              <div class="rating-card">
                <div class="rating-score" id="evidenceScore">0</div>
                <div class="rating-label">Evidence</div>
              </div>
              <div class="rating-card">
                <div class="rating-score" id="confidenceScore">0</div>
                <div class="rating-label">Confidence</div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="report-subsection">
            <div class="report-subsection-title">✅ Well-Defended Claims</div>
            <div id="strongClaims"></div>
          </div>

          <div class="report-subsection">
            <div class="report-subsection-title">⚠️ Claims Needing Improvement</div>
            <div id="weakClaims"></div>
          </div>

          <div class="report-subsection">
            <div class="report-subsection-title">💡 Specific Recommendations</div>
            <div id="recommendations"></div>
          </div>

          <div style="display: flex; gap: 8px; margin-top: 24px;">
            <button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="exportReport()">📤 Export Report</button>
            <button class="btn" onclick="startOver()">🔄 Start Over</button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- HELP MODAL -->
<div class="modal" id="helpModal">
  <div class="modal-content">
    <button class="modal-close" onclick="closeHelp()">×</button>
    <h2>How to Get the Most Out of This Interview</h2>
    <div style="font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.8; margin-top: 16px;">
      <h3 style="margin-top: 16px; color: var(--text-primary);">📤 Uploading Your Experience</h3>
      <p>You can upload:</p>
      <ul style="margin-left: 20px; margin-top: 8px;">
        <li>Resume (any format)</li>
        <li>LinkedIn profile (copy-paste the text)</li>
        <li>Project descriptions or portfolio summaries</li>
        <li>Cover letters or bios</li>
        <li>Research papers or case studies</li>
      </ul>

      <h3 style="margin-top: 16px; color: var(--text-primary);">🎯 Answering Questions</h3>
      <p style="margin-top: 8px;">Be specific and detailed. Generic answers get generic feedback. The more you share, the more personalized and useful the follow-ups become.</p>

      <h3 style="margin-top: 16px; color: var(--text-primary);">📊 Understanding Your Report</h3>
      <p style="margin-top: 8px;"><strong>Well-Defended Claims:</strong> These are claims you explained clearly with specific examples and context.</p>
      <p style="margin-top: 8px;"><strong>Claims Needing Improvement:</strong> These are vague, under-explained, or lack specific evidence.</p>
      <p style="margin-top: 8px;"><strong>Recommendations:</strong> Specific actions to strengthen your story before a real interview.</p>

      <h3 style="margin-top: 16px; color: var(--text-primary);">💾 Sessions</h3>
      <p style="margin-top: 8px;">Your sessions are saved locally in your browser. You can export your report as a document to review later or share.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<script>
// ==================== STATE ====================
let currentSession = null;
let uploadedContent = '';
let selectedStyle = 'professional';
let currentQuestionIndex = 0;
let questions = [];
let answers = [];
let defenseScores = {};

// ==================== FILE HANDLING ==========
